'''Gobble''' (タッキー, ''Takkī'', '''[[wikipedia:Hideaki Takizawa|Tackey]]''') is a [[:Category:Floating Enemies|Floating]] enemy that appears in [[The Aku Realms]] and [[Legend Stages]]. He was added in [[Version 9.3 Update|Version 9.3]].

