==Enemy==
A deadly turkey who stands at 200 range but has an [[Omni Strike]] that reaches even [[Crazed Lizard Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Manic King Dragon]], at 420 effective range, allowing him to hit even backline units. This is further augmented by his 35% [[Toxic]] ability which nukes any unit non-[[:Category:Cats with Toxic Immunity|immune to Toxic]] in up to three hits.

With his Toxic ability and 5,000 base attack, Gobble eliminates cats with...
*0 - 7,692 health in one attack
*7,693 - 33,333 health in two attacks
*33,333 or more health in three attacks

==Strategy==
Do not use short-ranged tankers against this feathered fiend, as the Toxic attacks will wear them down in almost no time; instead, rush him down with units such as [[Bahamut Cat (Special Cat)|Awakened Bahamut Cat]] and [[Express Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Bullet Train Cat]]. [[Swimmer Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Fishman Cat]] is especially useful against him, as Fishman has 15 more standing range and his foreswing is short enough to hit Gobble before he takes one. However, be careful when timing your units and make sure that there aren't bulky enemies in front of him, as those could shield this Toxic avian from your rushers' attacks.

[[Hades the Punisher (Uber Rare Cat)|Hades the Punisher]] and [[Gold Brick Cat (Special Cat)|King Nekokhamen]], with their Toxic Immunity, can tank lots of Gobble hits, but this will also result in Gobble easily reaching whatever that's behind them through his nasty Omni Strikes. [[Papaluga (Uber Rare Cat)|Papalan Pasalan]], the [[Ototo Corps#Curseblast Cannon|Curseblast Cannon]], and [[Kasli the Bane (Uber Rare Cat)|Kasli the Bane]] can temporarily disable Gobble's Toxic ability by [[Curse|cursing]] him. [[One-Eyed Asuka (Uber Rare Cat)|One-Eyed Asuka]] is a notable example, as while her Curse is less consistent, her Toxic Immunity means she doesn't have to fear it nevertheless as long as you can quickly remove Gobble before he accumulates too much damage on her.

With her Toxic Immunity Talent unlocked, [[Strike Unit R.E.I. (Uber Rare Cat)|Flight Unit R.E.I.]] can become an excellent counter to Gobble as she can tank Gobble's weak hits and remove him very easily.

