==Trivia==
*His Japanese name, Tackey, sounds like "turkey", but could also be a reference to [[wikipedia:Hideaki Takizawa|Hideaki "Tackey" Takizawa]], a record producer and former singer whose musical career began with the idol duo [[wikipedia:Tackey & Tsubasa|Tackey & Tsubasa]]. This is supported by Gobble's Japanese description, which describes him as "a popular idol turkey."
*Gobble's Japanese name is the same as [[Tackey]]'s English name.
*The "very bad news" in his description alludes to the day of [[wikipedia:Thanksgiving|Thanksgiving]], a holiday celebrated usually during October or November (as mentioned in his description), when Pilgrims originally celebrated their thanksgiving by eating wild turkey.
*Gobble's icon in the "Enemy Appearing" window shows him standing up, which doesn't occur in any of his animations.
**If one were to extract the raw "model" of Gobble in the game files, he is seen standing up.

